## Composition with other classes

- **`:mm/Memory`** — memorials reference their source via `:mm.memory/bootstrap-source` (ref-typed); the orthogonal `:mm.memory/bootstrap-override` flag opts out of regeneration
- **`:mm/Actor`** — `:mm.bootstrap-source/authored-by` references the actor(s) responsible for authoring this source

